  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia Health Transformation  Multi-Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia is providing support to the World Bank-managed Health Transformation Multi-Donor Trust Fund (MDTF) which aims to contribute to and be a key enabler of the Indonesia&#x2019;s Health System Transformation Agenda to strengthen primary and secondary health care, health financing, technology, talent, and health system resilience. The Health Transformation MDTF seeks to coordinate development partners&#x2019; support to assist the Ministry of Health in accessing analytical and technical expertise aimed at maximising the impact of the reform, in particular, to address critical gaps in accessibility and quality of health services for women and girls, people with disabilities, and climate resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
